cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the Authorized Recall@K metric, please cite it."
title: "Agentic Dataset Reference Implementation and Conformance Suite"
abstract: >-
  One behavioural contract for governed agentic datasets, expressed as fifteen
  conformance assertions (AD-001..AD-015), with a dependency-free reference
  control plane mapped onto four agent runtimes (a framework-free reference,
  LangGraph, LlamaIndex Workflows and Google ADK) and exercised across two
  dataset boundaries (local and MCP). Includes Authorized Recall@K, a
  retrieval metric defined over the subset of a corpus a principal is
  authorized to use.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Chernov
    given-names: Alexander
